@baseUrl = http://localhost:5091

### Reset the supplied fixture
POST {{baseUrl}}/demo/reset

### Read the drawer and current closeout
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/closeout

### Save an unfinished discrepant draft
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/closeout/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countedCashMinor": 17300,
  "explanation": ""
}

### This returns a validation problem
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/closeout/finalize

### Revise the explanation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/closeout/draft
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "countedCashMinor": 17300,
  "explanation": "Recounted; drawer is still short."
}

### Finalize
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/closeout/finalize

### Simulate a slow request and a single failure before mutation
PUT {{baseUrl}}/demo/behavior
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delayMilliseconds": 1000,
  "failNextMutation": true
}
